   218	V2's own correctness gate, so those six circuits silently fell back to the
   219	*interpreter*: the 1.44× "loss" was never measuring specialization at all. The
   220	correlation in the pre-fix data is perfect — all 20 circuits V2 wins ran
   221	`clifft_v2_spec`, all 6 it loses ran `clifft_v2_coop`.
