   271	**(e) The f32/f64 "gap" was never really about arithmetic precision.** It was a
   272	threshold constant calibrated for f64 and left in place when the storage became
   273	f32 — whose effect was to make one side consume a random number the other side
   274	did not, permanently desynchronizing the PRNG streams. Fixing one constant took
   275	same-stream agreement to **36/36 exact**. (§12)
