   501	   backend×circuit cells of the canonical run (job 50793), with no cell missing
   502	   — and why the matrix cores, the headline feature of this chip, are simply
   503	   not part of this story. §14.6 returns to what that costs.
   504	2. **The working set spans four orders of magnitude.** At peak rank 0 the
   505	   "statevector" is one complex number; at rank 24 it is 16.7 million. No single
   506	   parallelization strategy is right for both, which is the origin of the tier
   507	   system (§3.2).
   508	3. **Shots are embarrassingly parallel, but each shot is sequential.** A shot is
   509	   a walk through the bytecode with a private PRNG stream. The parallelism is
   510	   *across* shots, and the per-shot work is a dependent chain — which sets the
   511	   ceiling on what any amount of ILP inside one shot can buy.
