  2492	### 7.8 S6 — fused-matrix table lookup (a bounded gain)
  2493	
  2494	This case exists to establish an *upper bound on what specialization can do for
  2495	a data-dependent op*, and the case file says so:
  2496	
  2497	> S6 — fused-matrix table lookup. `v2_op_array_u2` indexes `fused_u2[cp]` then
  2498	> picks `matrices[in_state]` where `in_state` comes from the **LIVE Pauli
  2499	> frame**, so the row is **NOT foldable** — only the table entry `cp` and the
  2500	> axis are.

