  5813	**The d5 anomaly, stated precisely.** On all six d5-family circuits both
  5814	activity counters say ~0.62–0.65 while kernel time says 0.79–0.86. The GPU is
  5815	*less busy* on V2 and yet takes *longer* than that reduced busy-ness predicts.
  5816	This is the same set of six circuits that carry the entire busy-cycle residual
  5817	(§14.7) and the residual L2 deficit (§14.8, 91 % vs 98 %). Three counters, one
  5818	population, one unexplained mechanism. §16 records it as the chapter's main open
  5819	question.
