    13	- **No external references.** No `<image>`, no web fonts, no CSS `@import`, no
    14	  scripts. Font families are literal: `Arial, sans-serif` for prose,
    15	  `monospace` for code/identifiers. The file must render standalone in a
    16	  browser and inside a `<img src=...>` tag (so no inline `<style>` reliance on
    17	  the host document).
    18	- Background: a full-bleed `<rect width="W" height="H" fill="#1a1a2e"/>` as the
    19	  first painted element.
    20	- Canvas: 800–1100 wide, 420–620 tall. Pick per figure; wider for timelines,
    21	  taller for stacked pipelines.
    22	- **Nothing may overflow the viewBox and no two text elements may overlap.**
    23	  Compute your own layout arithmetic; do not eyeball. Text is not measured by
    24	  the browser here, so budget ~0.55 × font-size per character for
    25	  `Arial` width and ~0.6 × for `monospace`, and keep boxes wider than that.
    26	- Every number that appears in a figure must come from the DATA block of that
